"Storage","2 GB available space"],["Sound Card","Integrated or dedicated DirectX 9 compatible soundcard"]],"deck":3,"blurb":"Death Noodle Delivery puts you on the job as a new courier for a noodle delivery company in a grim cyberpunk city that seems close to falling apart. You ride a hoverboard around town to drop off orders, meeting the people who live there and slowly learning that the city hides something unpleasant beneath its neon surface.\n\nBetween deliveries you can modify your board and make unusual gadgets, including bombs shaped like cats. It is a single-player indie game with a casual pace and a quirky tone, mixing light action and role-playing with story. It suits players who like odd, small-scale adventures with plenty of personality."}}